\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 It was, therefore, wholly unsurprising that, on Sept 23, 2020, in the House of Lords, Alton asked the British foreign office minister, Lord (Tariq) Ahmad, if the government would "welcome" the initiative to set up the "}
